### 일반 사용자 로그인 - ADMIN 권한 없음
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/token
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "scott",
    "password": "tiger"
}

### 관리자 로그인 - ADMIN 권한 보유
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/token
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "scott2",
    "password": "tiger"
}

### Access Token 재발급
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/token/refresh
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "iuo2sp1hjie5v073c7fbum229ihnhttlnm52n58gsiq7kg9ab4t02miknl603a6308sngaibap809fhlsomd1oi5u4plmks6i7b64ria7n09l2nq23rp5a9smd32j9pm"
}